 "text": "Weiter zum Hauptinhalt\n\nWhy justclaims.eu\n\nAbout us\n\nResources\n\nRequest a Demo\nPwC and justclaims.eu are teaming up!\n\nIt’s about time to rethink your passenger claims handling processes, to save time as well as resources and to regain customer loyalty, enhance the user experience plus stimulate ticket sales through smart pay out options. Find our whitepaper below - produced by justclaims.eu in association with PwC.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nFurther information\n\nhttps://airlines.iata.org/blog/2020/02/sponsored-pwc-and-justclaimseu-are-teaming-up and\n\nStreamlining passenger_claims handling for the_post-COVID-19 era\n.pdf\nPDF herunterladen • 269KB\n\n\nAktuelle Beiträge\nAlle ansehen\nEurowings Discover forciert schnelle Streitbeilegung mit justclaims.eu\nEurowings Discover pushes fast dispute resolution with justclaims.eu\nEurowings Discover optimizes complaint management with justclaims.eu\n\nCHS Claims Handling Solutions GmbH \n\nGüterplatz 1\n60327 Frankfurt am Main\n\n​\n\nT +49 69 380 299 910\nF +49 69 380 299 911\n\nImprint\n\nPrivacy Policy",
